<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus invites 25,000 tonne barley tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus invites 25,000 tonne barley tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Wednesday issued a tender for the supply of one cargo of 25,000 tonnes of barley with a scheduled shipment in May or June, it said.</p>
<p>The tender closes on Tuesday, May 13, a statement from the grain commission said.</p>
